',2,'com.tiger.web.controller.system.SysVolunteerActivityRelationController.edit()','PUT',1,'admin','管理员室','/system/volunteerActivity/relation','127.0.0.1','内网IP','{\"activityId\":35,\"activityName\":\"志愿者招募│“河”我一起，保护母亲河！\",\"activityStatus\":\"2\",\"activityType\":\"2\",\"ask\":\"年轻、踏实肯干的青壮年\",\"attendPeopleCount\":2,\"contacts\":\"小吴\",\"contactsPhone\":\"13952365410\",\"describe\":\"<p>亲爱的朋友们：</p><p>为深入学习贯彻习近平生态文明思想，大力传承和弘扬雷锋精神，助力文明城市创建。团县委和浮梁县青年志愿者协会决定联合向社会公开招募青年志愿者，全面参与、全力服务护河行动，组建“河小青”护河志愿服务队伍。</p><p>期待您的加入！</p><p><strong>活动内容</strong></p><p>1.配合在浮梁县河流水域开展垃圾清理、环境美化、河道保护、文明劝导等巡河护河行动。</p><p>2.参加“随手拍、随手捡、随手护”等志愿服务。</p><p>3.走访浮梁县的社区、企业等，传播“河小青”绿色生态理念。</p>\",\"endTime\":\"2026-04-30\",\"imgs\":\"/profile/upload/2024/10/13/c2_20241013105526A017.png\",\"location\":\"江西省景德镇市浮梁县附近水域\",\"numberLimit\":8,\"organizationId\":7,\"organizer\":\"学雷锋小组\",\"registerTime\":\"2025-04-26\",\"relationId\":63,\"sex\":\"0\",\"startTime\":\"2025-10-08\",\"userApprovalStatus\":\"3\",\"volunteerId\":49,\"volunteerName\":\"11111\",\"volunteerStatus\":\"2\"}','{\"msg\":\"操作成功\",\"code\":200}',0,NULL,'2025-05-05 23:00:17',5),(1847,'志愿者活动关系',3,'com.tiger.web.controller.system.SysVolunteerActivityRelationController.remove()','DELETE',1,'admin','管理员室','/system/volunteerActivity/relation/63','127.0.0.1','内网IP','{}',NULL,1,'\r\n### Error querying database.  Cause: java.sql.SQLSyntaxErrorException: Expression #19 of SELECT list is not in GROUP BY clause and contains nonaggregated column \'student_volunteer.sv.id\' which is not functionally dependent on columns in GROUP BY clause; this is incompatible with sql_mode=only_full_group_by\r\n### The error may exist in file [D:\\zyfw_backend-master\\zyfw_backend-master\\tiger-system\\target\\classes\\mapper\\system\\SysVolunteerActivityRelationMapper.xml]\r\n### The error may involve com.tiger.system.mapper.SysVolunteerActivityRelationMapper.selectSysVolunteerActivityRelationById-Inline\r\n### The error occurred while setting parameters\r\n### SQL: sel